close_reason: "Delivered in PR 10: NODE_V8_COVERAGE is overridden to /dev/null for every spawned process in test/helpers/sandbox.ts, test/preflight.test.ts and the self-host fixture's git runner, so a spawned child can no longer corrupt the lcov the coverage gate is computed from."
